{"id":"n64368-1-18","stage":1,"title":"걸어오다 · 走来","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64368-1-18-1","ko":"야, 유민이 어디 있는지 알아?","zh":"喂，你知道裕敏在哪儿吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야,","meaning":"唷，嘿，哟","explanation":"야：唷，嘿，哟","readings":[{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58149","senseId":"1","lemma":"야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}},{"text":"유민이","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이","audio":"/audio/b0f813b33e356d859fe9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이","audio":"/audio/b0f813b33e356d859fe9.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는지","audio":"/audio/7df109195b78bcf9f45d.mp3"}},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아","audio":"/audio/afb5239ccd10c522dc68.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08945f015d460ad9","term":"야","zh":"唷，嘿，哟","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3","entryId":"58149","definition":"感到惊讶或高兴时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["야ː"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指